Package: capsa-llama-cpu
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: private baseline CPU llama.cpp server for Capsa
 This package contains the pinned llama-server and its matching shared
 libraries for Capsa.  It enables the CPU/OpenMP backend only and does not
 install CUDA libraries or model data.
